1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,054
Barely any juice from your lemon?

2
00:00:02,267 --> 00:00:04,532
Warm the whole lemon in the microwave for

3
00:00:04,542 --> 00:00:07,412
ten to fifteen seconds, then roll it
firmly

4
00:00:07,422 --> 00:00:09,476
on the counter before you cut it.

5
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:12,455
Rolling breaks the little juice sacs
inside, so

6
00:00:12,465 --> 00:00:15,111
you get a lot more juice from the same
fruit.

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,051
The full eight-trick guide is on the
channel.
